WEBVTT

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:20.800
Hello Gohan you've gotten so big great Goku won't be joining us today master Roshi

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:23.070
He ran off and left us in the car

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.920
None of us know how to drive

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:29.100
I'm just glad the words were clear

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.610
afternoon, the royal minuteless men suffered massive losses at the hands of the tyrannous

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:47.450
creature's cell. My heart weeps for these men, that these soldiers fought bravely to

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:54.310
the very end and will always be remembered and honored by the great nation for which

00:00:54.310 --> 00:01:00.000
they lay down their lives. With utmost honesty, I do not know what

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.980
More can be done, but I must ask you to remain strong.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:19.520
It's a difficult road happening.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:27.170
Oh, that's a new one.

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.000
And you say he's even strong.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.000
- Stronger than Frieza?

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.380
Must be hard for you to get good life insurance.

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:38.100
Trouble follows you like a lost puppy.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.920
- Yeah, and that's why it's so very important

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.500
that I find a new guardian for the Earth.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.740
All I need from you is the location of the Namek's.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.640
- Well, uh, uh...

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:51.400
- If you could at least point me in their general direction,

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.420
I would really appreciate the help.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:00.000
- Right, I'll take a look.

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:19.020
Think you'll find him? I hope so.

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:23.010
Mr. Popo's looking pretty lonely now that Kami's gone.

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:25.050
And you know, I don't blame him.

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:28.360
Yeah, that place is huge.

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:30.000
And it's pretty quiet when you're there.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:33.020
all by yourself. I remember this one time commie went on...

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:36.850
Hey, Brian! I'm trying to concentrate!

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:52.460
Can't you be serious?

00:02:54.290 --> 00:03:00.000
Sorry about that. Huh? Suitcase, I think I found them.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:07.380
Look, there! Let's see.

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:12.720
It didn't work last time, but if I know which way to look, then maybe I can...

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:16.680
See? Instant transmission. The Yardrads trick.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:22.700
Ooh, I bet they taught you that while you were staying with them, didn't they, didn't they, didn't they?

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:25.820
You know, I've always thought it had some handy uses.

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:30.000
I could have taught you, but you never asked me.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.720
you're making this hard

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:36.730
I'll be quiet

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:43.020
there we go

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:43.920
I've got it

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.860
wow I can't believe I missed it earlier

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:46.840
it was so obvious

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:49.200
oh well thanks for the help I guess

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:09.240
Look at all the piccolos.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:13.370
Elder, be careful.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.550
Are you friend or foe?

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.120
Um, friend.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:20.080
See, I've come from the planet Earth.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:22.200
My name is Goku, and I was just wondering--

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:26.110
Ah, then you must be the great Saiyan Goku,

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:30.000
the one who saved our people from Frieza.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:33.040
I remember it and Namek still blew up.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:38.470
Well, Goku, it seems your planet is the one in danger now.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:42.250
You mean you already know about the android that's attacking us?

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:49.310
Not in such detail, but we could sense the incredibly destructive energy that has been released on your planet.

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:52.580
Good, then I won't have to explain much.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:55.480
The source of the energy is an android named Cell.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:05:00.000
He's destroyed many lives on Earth, and we need the Dragon Balls to reverse what he's done.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:01.480
Makes sense, right?

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.020
Right, yeah.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:07.870
The problem is, all of our Dragon Balls are gone because our Guardian fused with Piccolo.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:08.930
Piccolo.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:12.570
Ah, you mean the Namek who Nail is fused with.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:14.020
Yeah, I guess so.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:17.640
Now, I was hoping that one of you guys would come and be our new Guardian.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:27.230
I know. We do have one person here who would love to be your new guardian.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:28.670
Oh, really?

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:30.000
Yeah.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.030
Dende

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:38.140
Come here my child

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:40.160
Yes, yes, sir

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:50.570
This one his name is Dende and he's very good friends with Krillin and your son gohan. Oh

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.920
Hey

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:55.460
He's been talking about the earth ever since

00:05:56.030 --> 00:06:00.000
He misses go on very much, and I think he'd really like to

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:07.320
see him. That'd be great. Except, will he be able to do the job? Oh, of course. Dendon

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:15.430
may be young, but he's exceptionally gifted. He'll be a wonderful guardian. Well then,

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:23.010
you're hired. Glad to meet you. Thank you. I'm glad, too. So, are you ready to get

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:30.000
going? Thanks a lot. We'll take good care of Dendon.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:39.970
from now on. I give you my word. Bye, everyone. Bye, Dende. Be a good guardian, Dende. Goku,

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:43.740
we shall keep your home in our thoughts. Good. Thank you.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:53.670
Hey, King Kai. I made it to the Namek's planet and everything worked out great, okay? Gotta go.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:00.000
Hey, look who I brought home for dinner.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:00.900
Good dinner, everybody.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:05.180
Uh, Dende, is he...

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:06.460
Yep.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.800
You sure it's not too much for him?

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.000
He's just a boy.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:14.720
Hey, don't worry.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.350
Now just sit tight.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.180
I'm gonna go pay a visit to Krillin and Gohan.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:44.880
Let's work you!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.280
Wolfball, he's the world champion of martial arts.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.860
Aren't you worried, Hercule, even a little?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:09.480
Cell destroyed the entire royal military with his power.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.100
What do you say to that?

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.820
This is all just a cheap trick.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.200
Cell planted bombs just before the military came.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.150
He might be an expert with explosives,

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:22.950
but as you can see from a martial arts standpoint, he's an amateur.

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:26.680
And, uh, Hercule, the greatest fighter in the world,

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:29.140
will quest that bait with my little finger!

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:32.150
Yell if you love me!

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:47.530
Now, where on earth have you been, Goku?

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:49.430
Do you think I know how to drive?

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:54.060
I'm sorry, Chi-Chi, but if I could just talk to Krillin and Gohan for a minute,

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:56.520
there's someone at the lookout who'd like to see them.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:57.600
Who is it, Dad?

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.380
Is this person, um...

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:01.890
Come on!

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:13.900
It's you!

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.780
It's been so long!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.780
Sure is good to see it, Dende.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:22.780
So is it true you're gonna take over Kami's position?

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:23.780
I think.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.780
Guardian of Earth.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:27.780
Wow, that's one heck of a title.

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.740
Now we can see each other every day!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:31.320
Yeah!

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:39.000
Now, Dende, are you absolutely certain you're ready to handle the Dragon Balls?

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.350
Lighten up, Piccolo.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:45.190
After all, the old guy told me that Dende was one of the most talented Namek's on their

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:46.330
planet.

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:48.200
Old guy?

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.640
About our Elder Mori.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.490
That's right!

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:55.930
That old guy said Dende had everything it takes to make a good guardian for Earth.

00:09:55.930 --> 00:10:00.000
I should be able to make new Dragon Balls within 100 years!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:19.510
Oh, no, we really can't wait that long balls and the model of the dragon then I should be able to do it right away

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:25.270
All right, the old dragon balls are scattered across the earth changed into stone

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:29.210
And yes, the dragon models in my room

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:32.810
Let's cook this dragon up.

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:33.810
Yeah!

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:36.800
Oh, hey, Dende, what about wishes?

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:39.730
Can you make it grant three just like on Namek?

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.010
Sure.

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:42.890
What about its power?

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:47.890
This isn't Namek, and with three wishes, the dragon might be weakened.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:52.890
Now think, can you make it bring back all those killed by Cell with one wish?

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:53.890
Oh!

00:10:53.890 --> 00:11:00.000
Well, I guess all I have to do is rechannel some of its energy into its wishing power.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:03.570
But that way, it can only grant two wishes each time.

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:07.680
Wow! You can really do all that?

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:12.670
Good enough. Make the dragon like that.

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:16.560
Yes, I'll try. So, should I start?

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:19.600
Mr. Popo, bring us the model, please.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:25.550
Yes. Here we are.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.680
Careful, I made this dragon myself.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:37.920
what an interesting shape okay i guess i'll begin good luck dinde yeah we're behind you all the way

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:47.760
hey thanks

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:27.720
can be summoned as soon as the Dragon Balls are collected. Already? Yes! Good work, Dende.

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:30.000
I always knew you'd be something great.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:36.330
Now, I'll borrow Bulma's Dragon Ball Radar and go collect them right away!

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:38.200
Good luck, Goku.

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:39.840
Yeah, thanks!

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:45.260
Hey, Gohan, why don't you stay here and have fun with Dende until the tournament begins?

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:47.400
Uh, are you sure?

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.920
I'm positive! Just have a good time.

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.730
Goku, uh, can I ask you one thing?

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:54.990
What's that?

00:13:54.990 --> 00:14:00.000
It's because you've discovered some sort of weak point to Cell that you're acting so calm and confident.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:00.970
Isn't it?

00:14:01.430 --> 00:14:04.820
Well, I'm afraid Cell doesn't have a weak point.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:08.950
All right, see you later.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:24.210
You really do just pop in and out of places, don't you?

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:26.890
You should take a look at the circuits on this guy.

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:28.590
Dr. Gero was a genius.

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:29.800
Huh.

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:32.600
Well, Bulma, I'm kind of in a hurry.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:37.520
See, I got the Earth some new Dragon Balls and I was hoping I could borrow your radar for a while.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.640
Oh, sure. The radar should be right there in the second drawer.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:57.100
Gee, thanks. Seems to be working. I should be able to find the Dragon Balls in no time at all.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:15:00.000
Well...

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.160
See ya.

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:02.270
Hey Goku.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:03.270
Oh well.

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:11.010
I was just going to ask him how Trunks is doing up there but I'm sure he's fine.

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:21.250
Must be close.

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:33.150
All right, it's right here

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:49.590
I don't see it. Did your father tell you anything?

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:56.070
We've all heard Goku say that cell is stronger than he is and that cell has no weaknesses

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:59.760
So why is he acting so cheerful?

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:05.670
"I've asked my dad and he hasn't told me anything! All he says is, 'Don't worry!'"

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:08.950
"Don't worry?"

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:13.950
"Oh, I mean if that's what he said, maybe he really does have some plan to defeat Cell."

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:24.060
"Or maybe he's in denial."

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:27.040
"What's up? It says it's here, but it's not!"

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:53.440
These heavy winds must have buried the Dragon Ball underneath the sand.

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:55.250
Thank you!

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:03.750
There goes nothing.

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:39.540
brought them back.

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:49.520
Dragon Balls have been restored, and the clock continues to tick, with each fighter passing

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:51.520
the time in the way he has chosen.

00:17:54.280 --> 00:18:00.000
Trey, some talk, and others seek to make sense out of it.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:02.370
that lie ahead.

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:31.330
Only five more.

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:38.430
Meanwhile, alone on the battleground, the mighty cell is waiting.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:57.100
You should not have given it this long.

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:08.810
My Dragon Ball Z!

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:10.810
Goku continues his search for the Dragon Balls

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:15.100
and encounters a handful of crime bosses.

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:18.500
And among these greedy crooks is an adversary from his past.

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:19.500
Aha!

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:23.460
Can Goku solve the fighter's puzzle and complete his mission?

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:26.560
Find out next time on Dragon Ball Z.
